# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ClaimsCopilot — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values before running the app.
# .env.local is git-ignored; never commit real API keys.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OPENROUTER_API_KEY  (NOTE: no VITE_ prefix — this is server-side only)
#   Consumed by the Vite dev middleware (vite.config.ts) locally, and by the
#   Vercel Edge function (api/chat/completions.ts) in production.
#   It is NEVER exposed to the browser bundle.
#
#   Get a key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
#   Keys start with: sk-or-v1-
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-replace-me

# When deploying to Vercel, set OPENROUTER_API_KEY in the project's
# Environment Variables UI — do NOT add it to a committed file.
